message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "java-metrics"
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool for reproducible structural metrics from Java source
  code, with deterministic output, explicit completeness status, provenance,
  a manually reviewed validation corpus, and optional CK integration.
